actly this statement. Lean status per paper is kept in authored/evidence-status.json.","citation_ids":["cite.long.thm-full-support-catalogue"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.thm-full-support-catalogue"],"id":"long.thm-full-support-catalogue","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 6.14 (Erdős–Borwein full-support irrationality, unconditional)","locator":"Long record Theorem 6.14, p. 48, label thm:full-support-catalogue","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*For every integer $b\\ge2$, the sum $\\sum_{n\\ge1}(b^n-1)^{-1}$ is irrational. This is Erdős’s theorem \\[erdos1948\\]; at base $2$ the sum is the Erdős–Borwein constant. The result concerns full support, not all its infinite subsets.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/long.thm-full-support-catalogue","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/long.thm-full-support-catalogue","id":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/edges/%5B%22long.thm-full-support-catalogue%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.irrational_erdosSum_full_support%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/edges/%5B%22long.thm-full-support-catalogue%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.irrational_erdosSum_full_support%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.irrational_erdosSum_full_support"},{"derived":true,"family":"provenance","from":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/evidence/mapping.long.thm-full-support-catalogue","id":"field:003962800ae0e80ab760c7c076c2c33e8eb0e392fc6ed407497cdc749e48b029","kind":"subject_ids","owner_ref":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/evide